Description: Splits chromosomes of large-genome species into smaller
    shards that respect the maximum contig size supported by 10x Genomics'
    'Cell Ranger ARC' reference builder, avoiding breaks inside gene
    bodies, and rewrites the corresponding 'GTF' annotation coordinates to
    match. This enables researchers to build custom 'Cell Ranger ARC'
    references for Multiome 'ATAC' and Gene Expression data from genomes
    that would otherwise exceed the tool's chromosome size limits.
